itted to finding natural, research-backed alternatives. \"Watching my wife unable to sleep comfortably for months was heartbreaking. Creating MenoMate became my personal mission—helping women maintain their active lifestyles throughout menopause.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSMsMeEKgb_text","label":"ggSMsMeEKgb_text","default":"<p>Together, our diverse expertise blends into <strong>one mission</strong>: to give you real, <strong>life-changing relief</strong> from menopause—so you can reclaim your comfort, confidence, and joy every single day.</p>"}],
